From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RCT Screensaver <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Screensaver: plugin files in the user folder and the
 clipboard

screensaver.readFile(name), writeFile(name, text) and listFiles() reach plain
JSON files in one folder, <user directory>/screensaver/live (filesFolder): bare
names of letters, digits, '.', '_' and '-' ending in .json, up to 8 MiB each.
Writes go to a temporary file renamed over the old one. The clipboard property
gets and sets the system clipboard's text.
---
 src/openrct2-ui/scripting/ScScreensaver.hpp | 140 +++++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 139 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

